|        Standard MG94 + 2 hits        |  -9088.13  |    0.0341  |    0.7208  |       0.0000 (2-hit rate = 0)      |    N/A     |                N/A                 |
|     Standard MG94 + 2 or 3 hits      |  -9085.91  |    0.0345  |    0.5093  |      0.0000 (2&3-hit rates = 0)    |    0.6837  |      0.0351 (3-hit rate(s) = 0)    |

